## Why This Is Asked
Tests deep React patterns: real-time streaming state, dynamic schemas, and per-field memoization in a multi-tenant context. It surfaces how to structure selectors, optimistic updates, and late-join consistency.

## Key Concepts
- useSyncExternalStore for per-workspace streams
- memoized selectors keyed by workspaceId, formId, fieldName
- React.memo Field components for performance
- optimistic updates with rollback on server validation
- replay of missed events for late joiners
- cleanup on workspace switch

## Code Example
```javascript
// skeleton: per-field selector factory
function makeFieldSelector(workspaceId, formId, fieldName) {
  return memoize((state) => {
    const field = state[workspaceId]?.forms?.[formId]?.fields?.[fieldName] || {};
    return {
      value: field.value,
      valid: field.valid,
      touched: field.touched
    };
  });
}
```

